  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Without evidence to the contrary, the proposed extension would lead to a loss of outlook from first-floor windows of both nos. 61 and 65 Melford Road, more specifically the bedroom and kitchen/dining room which these windows serve. This is considered harmful to the living conditions of occupiers of these habitable rooms and is therefore contrary to the aims and objectives of Policy 57 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which aims to protect outlook and avoid an increased sense of enclosure for existing occupiers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
